Dear Sir,

As per discussion we have check and found the application you are using is the Spectra BLE Admin Application, in which you have purchased a total of 52 tags. Out of these, 3 tags are blocked, and 49 are used. Your license has reached its limit, so you will need to purchase a new license. I am connecting you with the sales team, so please contact the sales team.

@Aditya Gothankar Please look into this for Spectra BLE Admin Application license reach.

