comments:
We took a remote session with the user and found that they had rejected all the pending applications by mistake. They wanted to change the status back to pending. To resolve this, we performed the following queries on the database, and now all the rejected application statuses have been changed from 'Rejected' to 'Pending' at HR/Admin:

Select * from lvtran where status='R';
Update lvtran set status='P' where status='R';

We took a remote session with the user and found that they wanted to change the company name in the NetXsControl Software from 'Madiba Consulting India Pvt Ltd' to 'Madiba Global Solutions Pvt Ltd.'

We attempted to make the change from the front end, but it was not editable. So, we gained database access and performed the following queries to update the company name from the backend:

SELECT * FROM Company;
SELECT * INTO Company_06022025 FROM Company;
UPDATE Company SET cmpName = 'Madiba Global Solutions Pvt Ltd' WHERE CmpCode = '01';
```"

solution:
We took a remote session with the user and found that they wanted to change the company name in the NetXsControl Software from 'Madiba Consulting India Pvt Ltd' to 'Madiba Global Solutions Pvt Ltd.'

We attempted to make the change from the front end, but it was not editable. So, we gained database access and performed the following queries to update the company name from the backend:

SELECT * FROM Company;
SELECT * INTO Company_06022025 FROM Company;
UPDATE Company SET cmpName = 'Madiba Global Solutions Pvt Ltd' WHERE CmpCode = '01';
```"

